# ExprTk (test oracle only)

The single header `exprtk.hpp` from https://github.com/ArashPartow/exprtk (commit in `COMMIT`), MIT licence (SPDX in the header).
It is used only by `crates/math/tests/oracle.rs` (feature `exprtk`) to check our own evaluator against an independent one.
It is never part of the runtime: it calls the platform maths library and so is not bit-reproducible across machines.
